ho took part (or why), but it serves as a good basis for coming up with any the Paths formed. I'd be less surprised if someone like Galbraith was involved, over Moncada and Vykos, as she at least has a demonic overlord to appease.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-23T02:33:01-08:00","id":1500441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1500430-world-building-the-judas-compact-or-how-the-sabbat-got-their-groove-stolen?p=1500439#post1500439\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The web link doesn't work, BTW. But this is a cool idea. I'm not entirely sold on those who took part (or why), but it serves as a good basis for coming up with any the Paths formed. I'd be less surprised if someone like Galbraith was involved, over Moncada and Vykos, as she at least has a demonic overlord to appease.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fixed the weblink.<br /> <br /> While theoretically possible, I wonder how much influence a Elder in Mexico City would have on the European Sabbat.<br /> <br /> As for why I chose those three (and it's only three + whoever else you wanted), it was based around a few factors:<br /> <br /> * Moncada is the spiritual leader of the Modern Path of Night and a Sabbat priest in the literal sense. However, the Modern Path of Night has nothing to do with the Dark Ages &quot;Road of Batman&quot; that was about avenging evil and protecting the innocent. So clearly Moncada changed it up significantly or went through his own spiritual crisis.<br /> <br /> * Velya the Vivisectionist, prior to gaining his &quot;wife&quot;, was someone who was considered one of the most singularly enlightened Tzimisce in the world. I think that was an interesting avenue to explore that he was once one of the original Road of Metamorphisis paragons but was happy to keep that bit of traditional Tzimisce lore out of the hands of modern Tzimisce. Basically, it means that regular Sabbat were not &quot;worthy&quot; of the real Tzimisce secrets.<br /> <br /> * Sascha Vykos was picked primarily for popularity power but also because of V5's suggestion that they're actually still up to their old tricks and not remotely affected by the Sabbat's current degeneration into football hooliganery. They're just sitting back and relaxing in their bunker according to Justin Achilli and waiting out Gehenna as the cannon fodder does the dying for them. If they've managed to weather the storm now, I could easily see them as the person who did this in the past.<br /> <br /> Thanks for your feedback.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-23-2022, 05:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-23T09:42:26-08:00","id":1500457,"title":"","content":"I liked your tips for how make Anarchs more fleshed out and I need to show it to my group.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2736